{"id": 517, "date": "2026-10-05T18:22:33", "date_gmt": "2026-10-05T18:22:33", "guid": {"rendered": "https://medluxlife.de/health/hospital-specialist-treatments/chest-diseases-pulmonology/", "raw": "https://medluxlife.de/health/hospital-specialist-treatments/chest-diseases-pulmonology/"}, "modified": "2026-10-07T18:20:15", "modified_gmt": "2026-10-07T18:20:15", "password": "", "slug": "chest-diseases-pulmonology", "status": "publish", "type": "page", "link": "https://medluxlife.de/health/hospital-specialist-treatments/chest-diseases-pulmonology/", "title": {"raw": "Chest Diseases (Pulmonology)", "rendered": "Chest Diseases (Pulmonology)"}, "content": {"raw": "<!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"medlux-intro\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center medlux-intro\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-lead\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-lead\">Chest diseases, or pulmonology, covers the diagnosis, treatment and long-term follow-up of conditions affecting the lungs and airways. The department at our partner hospital serves adult patients through its outpatient clinic, bronchoscopy unit, pulmonary function laboratory and allergy skin testing. MedLuxLife coordinates appointments and ensures that your previous scans and lung function results reach the specialist before you arrive.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":428,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-intro-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-intro-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-dept-chest-diseases.jpg\" alt=\"Chest Diseases - specialist hospital care\" class=\"wp-image-428\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-section\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Treatments and services</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-treatment-grid\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\",\"minimumColumnWidth\":\"20rem\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-treatment-grid\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Outpatient clinic</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Assessment, diagnosis and individual treatment planning for adults with respiratory symptoms or known lung disease.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Bronchoscopy unit</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Examination of the airways with a flexible camera to support diagnosis and, where needed, treatment.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Pulmonary function laboratory</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Breathing tests that measure how well the lungs are working.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Allergy skin testing</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Skin tests that can help identify allergic triggers for respiratory symptoms.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Smoking cessation support</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Counselling and follow-up for people who want to stop smoking.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Respiratory physiotherapy</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Breathing physiotherapy for hospitalised patients.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Medical treatment and follow-up</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Ongoing physician follow-up and adjustment of treatment for chronic lung conditions.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-section medlux-columns\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section medlux-columns\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Conditions treated</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Asthma</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Chronic bronchitis</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>COPD (chronic obstructive pulmonary disease)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Other smoking-related lung diseases</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Lung cancer</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Pneumonia</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Tuberculosis</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Interstitial lung diseases, including sarcoidosis</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Drug-induced lung problems</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Lung disease caused by occupational exposure</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-section\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Before you travel</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To get a reliable medical opinion quickly, please prepare:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Recent medical reports and discharge summaries</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Imaging (MRI, CT, X-ray) on CD or as DICOM files, with the radiology reports</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Recent laboratory results</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>A list of your current medications and any allergies</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Chest X-ray or CT images with reports</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Previous lung function (spirometry) results</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-section\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How MedLuxLife supports you</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-steps\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\",\"minimumColumnWidth\":\"20rem\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-steps\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Free consultation</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Share your wishes and, if available, recent X-rays or photos. We answer your questions and explain the options.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Personal treatment plan</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our partner specialists prepare a treatment plan and an estimated timeline tailored to you.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Travel &amp; treatment</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We coordinate your appointments, hotel and airport transfers, so you can focus on your treatment.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Aftercare</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We stay in touch after you return home and help with follow-up questions.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-cta\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-cta\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Plan your Chest Diseases (Pulmonology) consultation with confidence</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Every treatment begins with a personal, no-obligation consultation. Contact us and we will get back to you as soon as possible.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"medlux-btn-primary\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-primary\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://medluxlife.de/contact/\">Request a Free Consultation</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"medlux-btn-whatsapp\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-whatsapp\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://wa.me/380979092326\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WhatsApp</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-disclaimer\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-disclaimer\">The information on this page is for general guidance only and does not replace a medical consultation. Suitability for any treatment is assessed individually by a qualified doctor.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->", "rendered": "\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center medlux-intro is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-e35d3e13 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"medlux-lead wp-block-paragraph\">Chest diseases, or pulmonology, covers the diagnosis, treatment and long-term follow-up of conditions affecting the lungs and airways. The department at our partner hospital serves adult patients through its outpatient clinic, bronchoscopy unit, pulmonary function laboratory and allergy skin testing. MedLuxLife coordinates appointments and ensures that your previous scans and lung f